encers, high-pressure switches, and thermostats\u2014all in a realistic, immersive environment. This hands-on experience helps build technical confidence and job readiness for HVAC students, apprentices, and professionals preparing for certification or on-the-job performance.", "short_description": "HVAC Technician is a VR training app offering hands-on practice for diagnosing and replacing key HVAC components like fuses, contactors, breakers, sequencers, pressure switches, and thermostats. Build real-world skills in a safe, immersive environment ideal for technicians and students."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9303546633079574"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1229535071369702"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1743611439698561"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1229535071369702"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1749022980, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1229535071369702"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": 